---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';

const updated = 'November 11, 2026';
---

<Layout title="Terms & Conditions" description="Terms and Conditions for using anagramGenerator, the free browser-based anagram solver.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 md:py-24">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="display-xl mt-3 !text-4xl sm:!text-5xl">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
    <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-mute">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <div class="mt-12 space-y-10">
      <section>
        <h2 class="heading-md">Acceptance of terms</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-body">
          By using {SITE.name} you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="heading-md">Use of the service</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-body">
          The tool is free for personal and commercial use. You agree not to misuse the site, including attempting to disrupt it, scraping it at a rate that harms other users, or using it for unlawful purposes.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="heading-md">Accuracy of results</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-body">
          Results are generated from open-source word lists and may include unusual words or omit valid ones. They are provided for entertainment and general use, with no guarantee of completeness, accuracy or suitability for any purpose, including word games and competitions.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="heading-md">Intellectual property</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-body">
          The site’s design, code and content are owned by {SITE.name} unless stated otherwise. Word lists are credited on the <a class="text-link underline-offset-2 hover:underline" href="/about">About page</a> and remain under their own licenses. The anagrams you generate are yours to use.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="heading-md">Disclaimer of warranties</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-body">
          The site is provided “as is” and “as available” without warranties of any kind, express or implied. We do not promise that it will be uninterrupted or error-free.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="heading-md">Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-body">
          To the fullest extent permitted by law, {SITE.name} is not liable for any indirect, incidental or consequential damages arising from your use of the site.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="heading-md">Third-party links</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-body">
          The site may link to other websites. We are not responsible for their content or practices.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="heading-md">Changes to these terms</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-body">
          We may update these terms at any time. Continued use after a change means you accept the updated terms. See also our <a class="text-link underline-offset-2 hover:underline" href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="heading-md">Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-body">
          Questions about these terms? Email <a class="text-link underline-offset-2 hover:underline" href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
